/// Dimension: one row per supplied employee master record, identified by unique Employee Key. Department Key relates to Dim_Department; Employee Key filters Attendance, Payroll, Leave, Performance, Training and Exit facts. Job/grade/manager are denormalized extract attributes; no historical changes or complete rehire history is supplied. Hire and derived Exit Date support explicit lifecycle measures without a direct active Date relationship.
table Dim_Employee
	lineageTag: 1feac074-26a4-43e0-8f08-7eb25aea7e96

	/// Employee ID, sourced or reproducibly derived from the HR extract.
	column 'Employee ID'
		dataType: string
